OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fperiods overnight but staying mostly
OL,7,Fdry, fog forming by dawn where breaks
OL,8,Fin the cloud occur. Some showers may
OL,9,Flinger along the south coast. The wind
OL,10,Fremains light, but feeling cool with a
OL,11,Ffrost possible in rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FCloudy periods with mist and
OL,14,Ffog during the morning. Most areas
OL,15,Fstaying dry, with light winds,
OL,16,Falthough showers may continue to
OL,17,Faffect the south coast. Temperatures
OL,18,Faround normal for November.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
