OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells once fog patches clears on
OL,7,FSunday, most places remain dry. Clear
OL,8,Fstart for most on Monday but slowly
OL,9,Fclouding over. Cloudy with outbreaks
OL,10,Fof rain on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
